  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby approved shall be completed within three years of the date of this granting of prior approval.",
    "Condition : 2 - Notwithstanding the approved plans, the cycle parking shall be provided to ensure that there is a 1.2m wide aisle so that each space can be easily reached and shall be provided prior to the occupation of the hereby approved development and retained as such for the duration of the development without obstruction.",
    "Condition : 3 - 3.\tBefore the development hereby permitted is first occupied or brought into use, the Local Planning Authority shall be informed of the agreed naming and numbering of the approved dwellings so that arrangements can be put in place to ensure that, with the exception of a person eligible for a disabled person's badge issued pursuant to section 21 of the Chronically Sick and Disabled Persons Act 1970 (or similar legislation), no resident of the development shall obtain a resident's parking permit within any controlled parking zone which may be in force in the area at any time.  The developer or any successor in title shall ensure that this condition is brought to the attention of any prospective tenant or prospective purchaser prior to entering into any lease, tenancy or contract of sale.",
    "Condition : 4 - The electric vehicle charging points shall be capable of a minimum output of 7.2kW and shall be provided prior to the occupation of the hereby approved development and retained as such for the duration of the development without obstruction.",
    "Condition : 5 - The development shall be carried out in strict accordance with the submitted and approved Construction Management Logistics Plan- Rev C received 19/02/220 ensuring that there are no deliveries outside of the following hours: 09:30am to 15:00pm."
  ],
